  <title>
    <media type="image" width="40px" height="40px" its:translate="no" src="figures/orca-logo.svg" /> Actions
  </title>
  <p>
    Actions are operations an application or toolkit makes available for an item, such as
    activating a button, following a link, or expanding a collapsed item. The available actions
    depend on the item and the application.
  </p>
